[{"title":"摸鱼儿 太湖","author":"李演","text":"又西风、四桥疏柳，惊蝉相对秋语。\n琼荷万笠花云重，袅袅红衣如舞。\n鸿北去。\n渺岸芷汀芳，几点斜阳字。\n吴亭旧树。\n又系我扁舟，渔乡钓里，秋色淡归鹭。\n长干路。\n草莽疏烟断墅。\n商歌如写羁旅。\n丹溪翠岫登临事，苔屐尚黏苍土。\n鸥且住。\n怕月冷吟魂，婉冉空江暮。\n明灯暗浦。\n更短笛衔风，长云弄晚，天际画秋句。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65433,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉桃源 题小扇","author":"李演","text":"双鸳初放步云轻。\n香帘蒸未晴。\n杏熔暗泪结红冰。\n留春蝴蝶情。\n寒薄薄，日阴阴。\n锦鸠花底鸣。\n春怀一似草无凭。\n东风吹又生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65434,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生查子 寿陈宰妻","author":"李漳","text":"家承阀阅高，人擅闺房秀。\n嫁得伯鸾夫，直是齐眉偶。\n榴花著子时，萱草宜男候。\n一笑捧觥船，共祝人长寿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65435,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桃源忆故人 闺情","author":"李漳","text":"小楼帘卷栏干外。\n花下朱门半启。\n中有倾城佳丽。\n一笑西风里。\n盈盈临水情难致。\n尽日相看如醉。\n乾鹊不知人意。\n只管声声喜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65436,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 周监务生日，妻善鼓琴","author":"李漳","text":"雨歇前林，薰风度、琴声清淑。\n绮窗迥、张眉初扫，弄弦鸣玉。\n三叠瑶池仙侣宴，九江鹤唳清江曲。\n政伯鸾、此日梦维熊，祥烟馥。\n金徽外，音时续。\n雕筵上，听难足。\n且相将一醉，满倾醽醁。\n共祝遐龄何所似，水流不尽高山矗。\n算未应、归去抱琴书，云间宿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65437,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹊桥仙 七夕","author":"李漳","text":"迢迢郎意，盈盈妾恨，今夕鹊桥欲度。\n世间儿女一何痴，斗乞巧、纷纷无数。\n遥知此际，有人孤坐，心切天街云路。\n好因缘是恶因缘，梦魂远、阳台雨暮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65438,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 寿友人母","author":"李漳","text":"淑德由来孟母名。\n方瞳鹤发莹精神。\n天教遐算灵椿比，亲见贤郎擢桂荣。\n逢诞日，庆孙曾。\n金花纶诰又重新。\n愿君学得司空母，管取年高寿太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65439,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九里","author":"李熙载","text":"岩穴玲珑几度秋，簪峰高插耸鳌头。\n化人旧有阿罗汉，喜客今逢老比丘。\n石罅日闻甘露滴，山间时见庆云浮。\n灵岩特为南乡设，从此生贤继不休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65440,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"李熙载","text":"一门萃忠孝，竹帛写家声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65441,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其二","author":"李觏","text":"一年一度暂和谐，幽闭生心亦可猜。\n莫道乘槎无径路，支机曾属客星来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65442,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其一","author":"李觏","text":"无奈家家乞巧何，岂知天上拙人多。\n唤他乌鹊辛勤杀，才得扶舁渡浅河。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65443,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乡思","author":"李觏","text":"人言落日是天涯，望极天涯不见家。\n已恨碧山相阻隔，碧山还被暮云遮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65444,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马嵬驿","author":"李觏","text":"六军刚要罪杨妃，空使君王血泪垂。\n何事国忠诛死后，不将林甫更鞭尸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65445,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌鹊","author":"李觏","text":"乌鹊翩翩竞羽毛，南飞无树过良宵。\n就中管得他人事，秪与天孙倩作桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65446,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书景云轩壁","author":"李觏","text":"二江斜入似娥眉，尽日凭高把酒卮。\n贫贱别应无好处，猛忙中是我閒时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65447,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元纪二首 其二","author":"李觏","text":"君道乾刚岂易柔，谬牵文义致优游。\n高皇马上辛勤得，总被儒生断送休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65448,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元纪二首 其一","author":"李觏","text":"孝宣应是不知书，便谓先王似竖儒。\n若使周家纯任德，亲如管蔡忍行诛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65449,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孔光","author":"李觏","text":"王莽欲为先与草，董贤将过自迎门。\n省中树木何閒事，却对妻孥不肯言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65450,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"少年","author":"李觏","text":"新翻曲调恐人传，不许高声唱玳筵。\n金兽也嫌春态浅，向风喷作绿杨烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65451,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆钱塘江","author":"李觏","text":"昔年乘醉举归帆，隐隐前山日半衔。\n好是满江涵返照，水仙齐著淡红衫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65452,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方平","author":"李觏","text":"五百馀年别恨多，东征重得见青娥。\n擗麟始拟穷欢乐，不奈閒人背痒何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65453,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正月二十日俗号天穿日以煎饼置屋上谓之补天感而为诗","author":"李觏","text":"娲皇没后几多年，夏伏冬愆任自然。\n只有人间閒妇女，一枚煎饼补天穿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65454,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉宫","author":"李觏","text":"哀平外立国权分，只为当时乏嗣君。\n试问莽新谁佐命，最应飞燕是元勋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65455,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉胡蝶花","author":"李觏","text":"胡蝶生来只爱花，春工描样作奇葩。\n庄周有梦何曾觉，冰雪肌肤落几家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65456,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冰","author":"李觏","text":"水性本来弱，渐寒成此坚。\n东风有时到，几日是残年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65457,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"因游华子岗题麻源壁","author":"李觏","text":"平生犹未识红泉，今日才游石磴边。\n宿雨半晴秋草湿，困来无处可閒眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65458,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题玉台集","author":"李觏","text":"江右君臣笔力雄，一言宫体便移风。\n始知姬旦无才思，秪把豳诗咏女功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65459,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题荷花","author":"李觏","text":"昔人诗笔说莲花，不嫁春风早可嗟。\n今日倚栏添懊恼，池台多是属僧家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65460,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏赠月","author":"李觏","text":"梦中识路亦何为，恰要逢人已自迷。\n一月解行天一匝，嫦娥犹未免单栖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65461,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感 其三","author":"李觏","text":"庭下缧囚何忿争，刀笔少年初醉醒。\n黄金满把未回眼，笑杀迂儒欲措刑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65462,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感 其二","author":"李觏","text":"白刃劫君君勿言，人生祸难俱由天。\n君家岁计能多少，未了官军一饭钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65463,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感 其一","author":"李觏","text":"官家的的要宽征，古时什一今更轻。\n州县酷嫌民渐富，几多率敛是无名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65464,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬陈屯田途中所寄","author":"李觏","text":"封豕长蛇战岭南，何人肉食不怀惭。\n只今唯有高眠好，风弄松声水溅庵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65465,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答陈殿丞南塘观鱼见寄","author":"李觏","text":"鳞鬣摧残几许年，水平风静得潜渊。\n喜无美味登君俎，且学骊龙尽日眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65466,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答提刑孙都官二首 其二","author":"李觏","text":"真赏由来世上稀，几人相见不相知。\n如今一字成华衮，岂识龙章与凤姿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65467,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答提刑孙都官二首 其一","author":"李觏","text":"病树难随万木荣，闭门终日自愁萦。\n绣衣使者知何取，肯向民间问死生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65468,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自勉","author":"李觏"