3a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宗人宅折桂堂","author":"李觏","text":"从来皎月印长空，桂树遥看影在中。\n好问素娥多折取，莫教閒占水晶宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65488,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"屈原","author":"李觏","text":"秋来张翰偶思鲈，满箸鲜红食有馀。\n何事灵均不知退，却将閒肉付江鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65489,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳枝答","author":"李觏","text":"春早寒馀岂足哀，平生多难愧非材。\n去年二月都城里，曾共花房带雪来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65490,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鞦韆二首 其一","author":"李觏","text":"华郭春光欲暮时，綵绳争蹴夜忘归。\n佳人不道罗纨重，拟共杨花苦斗飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65491,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鞦韆二首 其二","author":"李觏","text":"风静高标埋暗雾，月明孤影落澄波。\n狂心拟逐游童上，无奈春醪足困何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65492,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"羿妻","author":"李觏","text":"有穷兵死为游畋，惆怅佳人独上仙。\n试问单栖与同穴，可能云汉胜重泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65493,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送古山人","author":"李觏","text":"喜闻吉事怕闻凶，天下人心处处同。\n乍出山来言语拙，莫将刺字谒王公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65494,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送杜万","author":"李觏","text":"谷口生涯已是贫，素衣还拟冒京尘。\n因风早寄登科信，装点江南几日春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65495,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周山人","author":"李觏","text":"鬼事无形尚可疑，人伦有验众皆知。\n武夷山路几百里，归去西风落叶时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65496,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送春","author":"李觏","text":"宜春台上送春归，泪滴金杯不自知。\n懊恼黄莺解言语，飞来唯见落花枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65497,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送春寄呈祖袁州二首 其二","author":"李觏","text":"东君此去几时来，雪里梅根待暖回。\n莫似仙家寥落甚，蟠桃千岁始重开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65498,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送春寄呈祖袁州二首 其一","author":"李觏","text":"去年春尽在宜春，醉送东风泪满巾。\n今日春归倍惆怅，相逢不是去年人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65499,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送毗师西游","author":"李觏","text":"望望王城十二门，青山行尽入红尘。\n近来富贵皆天与，到处应多问命人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65500,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送夏旦赴举","author":"李觏","text":"岭梅初尽草初生，马上春风酒易醒。\n好共大鹏双奋击，此行有路到南溟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65501,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧游庐山","author":"李觏","text":"行非为客住非家，此去庐山况不遐。\n要见南朝旧人物，池中唯有白莲花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65502,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻莺","author":"李觏","text":"才转歌喉碧树枝，惊飞还避巧丸儿。\n可怜蜂蝶无言语，入遍花房人未知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65503,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓角","author":"李觏","text":"肠断城头画角声，灯青月黑酒微醒。\n浓香梦里谁曾管，只有离人夜夜听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65504,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读长恨辞二首 其二","author":"李觏","text":"蜀道如天夜雨淫，乱铃声里倍沾襟。\n当时更有军中死，自是君王不动心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65505,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读长恨辞二首 其一","author":"李觏","text":"玉辇迢迢别紫台，系环衣畔忽兴哀。\n临邛谩道蓬山好，争奈人间有马嵬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65506,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读皮袭美病中书事诗有可怜真宰意偏解困吾曹之句偶代答之","author":"李觏","text":"刺虎屠龙古有名，事于难处迭相矜。\n要知真宰争功意，困得英雄始是能。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65507,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸭","author":"李觏","text":"庶人常用贽，贵在不飞迁。\n饱食待庖宰，虚教两翅全。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65508,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜才","author":"李觏","text":"丑妇易为洁，愚儿多守纯。\n天将恶文采，万物恐无春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65509,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜才","author":"李觏","text":"子云辞赋似相如，自说雕虫异壮夫。\n何事犬羊誇质素，患他人爱著貂狐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65510,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]